Now we start.

Step 1: allocate dispatch slot for shift_candidate_alpha.

Action: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate ?candidate - candidate_entity ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile

Preconditions:
- dispatch_ready ?candidate (shift_candidate_alpha true)
- candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile (shift_candidate_alpha linked to route_task_profile_alpha true)
- dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (dispatch_slot_alpha true)
- not dispatch_allocated ?candidate (currently false)

Thus we can execute.

Effect:
- dispatch_allocated ?candidate (shift_candidate_alpha)
- candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot
- not dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (makes slot unavailable)

Now state: dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha true, dispatch_slot_available false.

Step 2: execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha

Preconditions:
- dispatch_allocated ?candidate (true)
- candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit (shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma true)
- candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot (true)
- not dispatched ?candidate (false)

Effect:
- dispatched ?candidate (shift_candidate_alpha)
- vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit (vehicle_unit_gamma)
- dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (makes slot available again)

Now after step2:
- dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true
- vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true
- dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha true
- dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha still true? Effect does not remove dispatch_allocated. So dispatch_allocated remains true. That's fine.
- candidate_dispatch_slot_linked remains true.

Goal requires dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true (yes). dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true (yes). vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true (yes). Good.

Now shift_candidate_alpha done.

Now we need to release compliance certificate from shift_candidate_alpha to make it available for beta.

Step3: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha

Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (true)

Effect:
- compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha
- not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha

Now compliance_certificate_alpha available.

Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta.

Step4: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma

Preconditions:
- candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true)
- not vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (false currently)
- vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma (true after step2)

Effect:
- vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true
- candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma true
- not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma (makes it unavailable)

Now shift_candidate_beta has vehicle allocated and linked.

Step5: attach_task_profile shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true)
- vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (now true)
- route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true initially)

Effect:
- candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha true
- not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (makes it unavailable)

Now shift_candidate_beta has task profile linked.

Step6: confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true)
- vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (true)
- candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (true)
- not candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (false currently)

Effect:
- candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta true

Now shift_candidate_beta prepared.

Step7: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha

Preconditions:
