- not operator_available driver_operator_alpha (makes operator unavailable)

Now operator linked to beta.

Step8: apply_operational_constraint shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true)
