- operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_beta (true initially)
- candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta (true from init)
- not constraint_applied shift_candidate_beta (false)

Effect:
- constraint_applied shift_candidate_beta true
- not operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_beta (makes it unavailable)

Step9: assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha

Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true)
- compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha (true after step3)
